T1  - MIoT-CDPS: Complete decentralized privacy-preserving scheme for medical internet of things
AU  - Park, Kisung
AU  - Park, Youngho
JO  - Internet of Things
VL  - 27
SP  - 101250
PY  - 2024
DA  - 2024/10/01/
