T1  - Is all that glitters gold? Assessing the quality and ethics of ‘gold standard’ randomised controlled trials conducted in Aboriginal and Torres Strait Islander settings
AU  - Luke, Joanne
AU  - Verbunt, Ebony
AU  - Bamblett, Muriel
AU  - Salamone, Connie
AU  - Gafforini, Sarah
AU  - Zhang, Angela
AU  - Thomas, David
