T1  - Smartphone Apps for Containing the COVID-19 Pandemic in Germany: Qualitative Interview Study With Experts Based on Grounded Theory
AU  - Krämer, Dennis
AU  - Brachem, Elisabeth
AU  - Schneider-Reuter, Lydia
AU  - D'Angelo, Isabella
AU  - Vollmann, Jochen
AU  - Haltaufderheide, Joschka
