T1  - An open-weight Large Language Model agent for condition monitoring and predictive maintenance in wind energy systems
AU  - Hasan, Agus
AU  - Widyotriatmo, Augie
AU  - Nguyen, Dong Trong
JO  - Energy and AI
VL  - 25
SP  - 100828
PY  - 2026
DA  - 2026/09/01/
